{
    "title": "Princess Baby Phone Game",
    "description": "Princess baby phone game is a fun and educational phone simulator for kids & toddlers. In this game, kids can pretend to be a princess and take care of their own phone. They can make & answer calls, play 25+ mini games, learn about numbers, letters, colors and many more.\r\n\r\n<b>Princess Baby Phone Game Activities:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2714 <b>ALPHABET & NUMBERS:</b> Learn to pronounce the alphabet and numbers\r\n\u2714 <b>PRINCESS DRESS-UP:</b> Choose from a variety of outfits and accessories to create your own unique princess\r\n\u2714 <b>NAIL ART:</b> Create nail designs with fabulous colors, glitters, fashion gems and cute nail polish stickers\r\n\u2714 <b>COLORING BOOK:</b> Fill your favorite colors with different princess coloring pages\r\n\u2714 <b>PRONUNCIATION:</b> Listen to the voice of an animal, bird & pronounce the vegetables & fruits\r\n\u2714 <b>COLOR NAME:</b> Learn the name of the different color with the dial button\r\n\u2714 <b>PHONE CALL:</b> Calling an animals, birds, numbers & colors with baby phone\r\n\u2714 <b>POP IT FIDGET:</b> Many shapes of colorful pop it toys\r\n\u2714 <b>MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS:</b> Use your fingers to play with Drums, Piano, Trumpet and Xylophone\r\n\u2714 <b>PUZZLES:</b> Exercise your brain and sharpen your memory with Jigsaw Puzzle, Alphabet Shadow Match, Memory Match and Find the object puzzle\r\n\u2714 <b>COUNTING:</b> Learn to count an objects\r\n\u2714 <b>SURPRISE EGG:</b> Get the surprise toys by cracking the chocolate eggs\r\n\u2714 <b>ATTRACTIVE GAME THEME:</b> Specially designed the theme concept on baby phone for girls\r\n\u2714 <b>BALLOON POP:</b> Pop the colorful balloons",
    "descriptionHTML": "Princess baby phone game is a fun and educational phone simulator for kids &amp; toddlers. In this game, kids can pretend to be a princess and take care of their own phone. They can make &amp; answer calls, play 25+ mini games, learn about numbers, letters, colors and many more.<br><br><b>Princess Baby Phone Game Activities:</b><br><br>\u2714 <b>ALPHABET &amp; NUMBERS:</b> Learn to pronounce the alphabet and numbers<br>\u2714 <b>PRINCESS DRESS-UP:</b> Choose from a variety of outfits and accessories to create your own unique princess<br>\u2714 <b>NAIL ART:</b> Create nail designs with fabulous colors, glitters, fashion gems and cute nail polish stickers<br>\u2714 <b>COLORING BOOK:</b> Fill your favorite colors with different princess coloring pages<br>\u2714 <b>PRONUNCIATION:</b> Listen to the voice of an animal, bird &amp; pronounce the vegetables &amp; fruits<br>\u2714 <b>COLOR NAME:</b> Learn the name of the different color with the dial button<br>\u2714 <b>PHONE CALL:</b> Calling an animals, birds, numbers &amp; colors with baby phone<br>\u2714 <b>POP IT FIDGET:</b> Many shapes of colorful pop it toys<br>\u2714 <b>MUSICAL INSTRUMENTS:</b> Use your fingers to play with Drums, Piano, Trumpet and Xylophone<br>\u2714 <b>PUZZLES:</b> Exercise your brain and sharpen your memory with Jigsaw Puzzle, Alphabet Shadow Match, Memory Match and Find the object puzzle<br>\u2714 <b>COUNTING:</b> Learn to count an objects<br>\u2714 <b>SURPRISE EGG:</b> Get the surprise toys by cracking the chocolate eggs<br>\u2714 <b>ATTRACTIVE GAME THEME:</b> Specially designed the theme concept on baby phone for girls<br>\u2714 <b>BALLOON POP:</b> Pop the colorful balloons",
